cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Maryland Hospital Global Budget Revenue Tracker
message: >-
  If you use figures from this page, please cite the underlying dataset
  (maryland-hospital-data) rather than the page.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmadi
    given-names: Farzin
    affiliation: Towson University
    email: fahmadi@towson.edu
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0606-1707
repository-code: https://github.com/farzinahmadi/maryland-gbr-tracker
url: https://farzinahmadi.github.io/maryland-gbr-tracker/
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A public tracker of Maryland's all-payer hospital global budget system,
  compiled from Health Services Cost Review Commission filings. Covers regulated
  revenue, admissions, payer mix and financial margins for the hospitals
  reporting under global budgets, with a hospital map, a plain-language primer
  on how global budgets work, and links to the compiled open dataset.
keywords:
  - Maryland
  - global budget revenue
  - all-payer model
  - hospital finance
  - health policy
  - HSCRC
